Vicious Gambling Agreement game updated to version 1.1.1,
update content:
Merge multiple language versions into a single all language version;
Language can be changed directly in the game, save and restart the game to take effect;
Increase in-game hint information;
The main languages of the game include: Chinese and English, and the extended languages include: Japanese, Russian and German. The extended language is machine translation. The purpose is to read by players who do not understand Chinese and English.

Note: Due to the merged version of the game language, users who have previously downloaded the game may have desktop shortcuts that cannot be launched. You must delete the old shortcut and regenerate a shortcut to take effect.Sorry for any inconvenience caused!

